{
name = note;
value = "# Adjustment notes\012\012- All legacy marks have been made out of components to reduce the repetition in hinting\012- All accent marks have been slightly modified in height and position to align better. This is true in ALL optical sizes\012\012- Numbers (0123456789) (+tf variants) jump at optical size 14 to avoid a form morphing in interim steps (Angled to straight forms), which can look strange.\012\012\012– symbols – fixed minor spacing errors (tabular forms in the period.tf comma.tf colon.tf)\012\012– tcommaaccent.alt had an incorrect form \012– tcedilla.alt was missing. Added in!\012– jdotless.alt jcircumflex.alt added\012– t_f t_f.alt – changed the f terminal to be inline with all of the other f components";
},
{
name = Axes;
value = (
{
Name = "Optical size";
Tag = opsz;
},
{
Name = Weight;
Tag = wght;
}
);
